Cell["\<\
The signature for a given property depends on whether or not the wavepacket \
depends on time.  GWPObject uses the property's \"StaticClass\" for \
time-independent wavepackets, and uses the property's \"DynamicClass\" for \
time-dependent wavepackets.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.997830367455748*^9, 3.997830472533744*^9}, {
  3.997830529665011*^9, 3.997830637312096*^9}},
 CellID->738463272,ExpressionUUID->"49325870-24f5-4593-8b8c-5ea22be5fe0c"],

Cell["\<\
Construct a time-independent 1D GWPObject using the default value of None for \
the \"Potential\" option:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.997830005470582*^9, 3.997830065440126*^9}, 
   3.997830097071267*^9},
